  },
  {
    "start": 64.4,
    "duration": 3.52,
    "text": "come along and join us. I'm going to go"
  },
  {
    "start": 66.24,
    "duration": 3.68,
    "text": "and get ready now in the pod. I'm just"
  },
  {
    "start": 67.92,
    "duration": 4.16,
    "text": "hiding out in the van here cuz there was"
  },
  {
    "start": 69.92,
    "duration": 4.24,
    "text": "a few people kicking about and I didn't"
  },
  {
    "start": 72.08,
    "duration": 3.76,
    "text": "want them looking. I was thinking, who's"
  },
  {
    "start": 74.16,
    "duration": 4.32,
    "text": "that weirdo talking to myself on the"
  },
  {
    "start": 75.84,
    "duration": 7.16,
    "text": "camera? So, right, Mandingos, I'll bring"
  },
  {
    "start": 78.48,
